{"id":"u-015b48b3-5942-43d3-b325-8799630e7256","src":"community","title":"Upper / lower (bodybuilding)","author":"Jef P.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/A8og1N-notes260615130643","desc":"Make it a 4-week-program. \nweek 1 should be light (RPE 6-7). \nweek 2 should be around the same weight you ended this program previously (RPE 8). \nweek 3 should be a little harder than week 2. \nweek 4 should be really hard (RPE 9-10). \n\nAfter this you can start the program again from week 1 or take a deload first. I recommend that you switch a few exercises each time you do the program again, especially the ones where you don't make as much progress or have been doing for a long time.\n\nUnlock your potential with the program, a dynamic 4-week training plan designed for those ready to elevate their fitness game. Comprising four targeted sessions each week, this program focuses on building muscle. Whether you're a seasoned lifter or just starting out, you'll find a balanced mix of exercises that challenge your body and keep you engaged. Get ready to push your limits and see results in just 4 weeks!","level":["Intermediate","Advanced","Novice"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":100,"joins":7,"rate":5,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-09-17T17:41:23.126Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower A","Upper A","Lower B","Upper B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Overhead Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Extensio